<title>COLOMBIA: Colombia's Bavaria Q1 net up 22.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Colombia's Bavaria Q1 net up 22.7 pct.</headline>
<text>
<p>BOGOTA, May 13 Reuter - Colombian brewing company Bavaria reported the following first-quarter results, the securities superintendency said Tuesday:</p>
<p>Net profit Q1 1997 26.07 billion pesos vs 21.24 billion pesos in Q1 1996.</p>
<p>Total assets 4.37 trillion pesos against 3.6 trillion.</p>
<p>Operating income 200.5 bln pesos against 180.9 bln pesos.</p>
<p>((-- Karl Penhaul, Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944))</p>
</text>
